本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p002","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-jiong:p002:m0182","surface":"孫輔","start":182,"end":184,"person_id":"ucg_nrt_zl8","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-jiong:p002","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-jiong"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-lun:p012:m0021","surface":"孫輔","start":21,"end":23,"person_id":"ucg_nrt_zl8","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-lun:p012","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-lun"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-lun:p012:m0386","surface":"孫輔","start":386,"end":388,"person_id":"ucg_nrt_zl8","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-lun:p012","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-lun"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-lun:p012:m0401","surface":"輔","start":401,"end":402,"person_id":"ucg_nrt_zl8","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-lun:p012","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-lun"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-lun:p012:m0517","surface":"孫輔","start":517,"end":519,"person_id":"ucg_nrt_zl8","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-lun:p012","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-lun"},{"id":"c-jinshu-060-sunqi:p001:m0113","surface":"輔","start":113,"end":114,"person_id":"ucg_nrt_zl8","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-060-sunqi:p001","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-060-sunqi"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p002","text":"冏因眾心怨望，潛與離狐王盛、潁川王處穆謀起兵誅倫。倫遣腹心張烏覘之，烏反，曰：「齊無異志。」冏既有成謀未發，恐或泄，乃與軍司管襲殺處穆，送首於倫，以安其意。謀定，乃收襲殺之。遂與豫州刺史何勖、龍驤將軍董艾等起軍，遣使告成都、河間、常山、新野四王，移檄天下征鎮、州郡縣國，咸使聞知。揚州刺史郗隆承檄，猶豫未決，參軍王邃斬之，送首於冏。冏屯軍陽翟，倫遣其將閭和、張泓、孫輔出堮阪，與冏交戰。冏軍失利，堅壘自守。會成都軍破倫眾于黃橋，冏乃出軍攻和等，大破之。及王輿廢倫，惠帝反正，冏誅討賊党既畢，率眾入洛，頓軍通章署，甲士數十萬，旌旗器械之盛，震於京都。天子就拜大司馬，加九錫之命，備物典策，如宣、景、文、武輔魏故事。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p002:m0015","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"冏","kind":"person","person_id":"ee0_b2a_68e","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p002:m0016","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"王盛","kind":"person","person_id":"lwd_93l_vo3","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p002:m0017","start":16,"end":19,"surface":"王處穆","kind":"person","person_id":"414_jrh_fj0","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p002:m0018","start":23,"end":24,"surface":"倫","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAG","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p002:m0019","start":25,"end":26,"surface":"倫","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAG","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p002:m0020","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"張烏","kind":"person","person_id":"1gn_92g_8z7","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p002:m0021","start":34,"end":35,"surface":"烏","kind":"person","person_id":"1gn_92g_8z7","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p002:m0022","start":40,"end":41,"surface":"齊","kind":"person","person_id":"ee0_b2a_68e","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-jiong:p002:m0023","start":46,"end":47,"surface":"冏","kind":"person","person_id":"ee0_b2a_68e","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},